end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "237432db-d99e-4668-9040-99387911c097": {"__data__": {"id_": "237432db-d99e-4668-9040-99387911c097", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 31}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The committee approved a plan to pedestrianize the historic city center.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "5784b7d3-dcd2-4fbb-bfb8-2ed2b2a31feb": {"__data__": {"id_": "5784b7d3-dcd2-4fbb-bfb8-2ed2b2a31feb", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 32}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "A fishing ban was extended to help depleted stocks recover.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "d8680960-d59e-4ca8-b714-ec878d4230d5": {"__data__": {"id_": "d8680960-d59e-4ca8-b714-ec878d4230d5", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 33}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The telecom operator launched fifth-generation service in rural counties.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "fcdcf541-ae7c-4685-af9a-43b89fdecfd9": {"__data__": {"id_": "fcdcf541-ae7c-4685-af9a-43b89fdecfd9", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 34}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The museum returned a looted artifact to its country of origin.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "6a9d9639-42e9-4adf-b7ac-cda6256f45d6": {"__data__": {"id_": "6a9d9639-42e9-4adf-b7ac-cda6256f45d6", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 35}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "A drought reduced the river flow to a record low, threatening fish stocks.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "cf96440b-0728-434c-bdd2-4513a9394384": {"__data__": {"id_": "cf96440b-0728-434c-bdd2-4513a9394384", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 36}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The port handled a record volume of container traffic this quarter.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "3eaa5254-2e48-44a4-a6c3-68cca88fbad6": {"__data__": {"id_": "3eaa5254-2e48-44a4-a6c3-68cca88fbad6", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 37}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "A study found that walking thirty minutes daily lowers the risk of heart disease.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "4a00ac49-733e-4cb0-8c94-bb18a8089f38": {"__data__": {"id_": "4a00ac49-733e-4cb0-8c94-bb18a8089f38", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 38}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The airline canceled two hundred flights due to a strike by ground crew.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "0898d339-9a04-4d5e-9b23-15a3dfba362d": {"__data__": {"id_": "0898d339-9a04-4d5e-9b23-15a3dfba362d", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 39}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "A hiker was rescued after being lost for three days in the mountain range.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "e120b112-eea8-476e-bac6-12d84dd48ae7": {"__data__": {"id_": "e120b112-eea8-476e-bac6-12d84dd48ae7", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 40}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Language model passes medical licensing exam, port handles record container traffic, cyberattack disrupts rail services, hospital opens new wing, public trust in institutions declining, factory recall on electric scooters, startup raises $50M for battery recycling, local football team wins championship.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "642c0478-75bf-4b4a-8091-d8c33c6cf479": {"__data__": {"id_": "642c0478-75bf-4b4a-8091-d8c33c6cf479", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 41}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Museum returns looted artifact, new deep-sea species discovered, mayor plans tree planting, retailer data breach, streaming service royalties increased, central bank raises interest rates, blockchain project loses funds, government offers solar panel subsidy.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "d3bb72b7-972a-4375-a067-10ad343ea2dd": {"__data__": {"id_": "d3bb72b7-972a-4375-a067-10ad343ea2dd", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 42}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Rare transit visible, film festival awards climate change doc, energy company switches to wind, earthquake damages bridges, tech startup launches open-source GPU model, wildfire evacuates 2,000, university expands scholarship, bridge reopens after renovation.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "14aca434-b0ec-4bbc-a3cd-b32ffcbac0a1": {"__data__": {"id_": "14aca434-b0ec-4bbc-a3cd-b32ffcbac0a1", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"index": 43}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "met